# P13 batch 8
msgctxt "book 0592:455C"
msgid "GUARD LOG: ~~Bloodwatch: Nothing to report. ~~Firstebb: Flogged some peasants. ~~DayTide: Broke up a fight. Probably broke the sod's nose. ~~Threemoons: Nothing to report. ~~Lastebb: Helped peasant remember where he hid his taxes. Heh, heh... ~~Eventide: Guard changed. "
msgstr "衛兵日誌：~~血巡守：無事可報。~~初退潮：鞭打了幾個農民。~~晝潮：勸開了一場打架。大概把那傢伙的鼻子打斷了。~~三月時：無事可報。~~終退潮：幫一個農民想起他把稅金藏在哪裡。嘿嘿……~~暮潮：換班。"

# P13 batch 8
msgctxt "book 0592:4668"
msgid "GUARD LOG: ~~Bloodwatch: Ate doughnuts. Stale. ~~Firstebb: Helped peasants pay taxes. ~~DayTide: Guard Changed. ~~Threemoons: Arrested somebody. Forget what for... ~~Lastebb: Ate doughnuts. Still Stale. ~~Eventide: Nothing to report. "
msgstr "衛兵日誌：~~血巡守：吃了甜甜圈。不新鮮。~~初退潮：幫農民繳稅。~~晝潮：換班。~~三月時：逮捕了某人。忘了是為什麼……~~終退潮：吃了甜甜圈。還是不新鮮。~~暮潮：無事可報。"

# P13 batch 8
msgctxt "book 0592:47B9"
msgid "GUARD LOG: ~~Bloodwatch: Guard changed. ~~Firstebb: Helped take children on tour of the dungeon. ~~DayTide: Ate doughnuts. Stale. ~~Threemoons: Arrested peasant. Resisted arrest. Had to use force. ~~Lastebb Nothing to report. ~~Eventide: Caught kids throwing rocks. None of them damaged too terrible... "
msgstr "衛兵日誌：~~血巡守：換班。~~初退潮：協助帶孩子們參觀地牢。~~晝潮：吃了甜甜圈。不新鮮。~~三月時：逮捕農民。拒捕。不得不動用武力。~~終退潮：無事可報。~~暮潮：抓到一群丟石頭的小孩。沒有一個傷得太嚴重……"
